  <sect2 role="package">
    <title>Introdução ao "Clisp"</title>

    <para>
      <application>GNU Clisp</application> é uma implementação "Common Lisp" que
inclui um interpretador, compilador, depurador e muitas extensões.
    </para>

    <note>
      <para>
        This package has not had a 'stable' release since 2010. The package here was
created from the <ulink url='https://gitlab.com/gnu-clisp/clisp'>upstream
git repository</ulink> in order to enable it to be built with gcc-15. The
most recent commit was May 2025.
      </para>
    </note>

    &lfs124_checked;

